    "group": "00378892788a9b5a60f258b6304b1cf88884e7b54b0ae2e849b407a6925a7d21",
    "input": {
      "line": "评分中只有 GLP‐1 receptor agonists 同时具备非零突现强度（11.0）与高增长，其余九项并列 0.600，突现得分为 0。这些主题的增长率同为 1.00，在低基数下即可取得，所以这一列不能读作研究规模已经扩大。它们的定位是「新近出现、值得跟踪」，而不是已形成的研究方向。"
    },
    "expected": {
      "leakage": false
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "nonclinical-bibliometric-analysis-196",
    "source": "nonclinical-delivered-report",
    "sourcePath": "OpenScience/evals/bibliometric-analysis/results/2026-10-04-biblio-001-glp1-obesity-landscape/deliverable/deliverables/glp1-obesity-bibliometric/bibliometric-analysis-report.md",
    "sourceSha256": "00378892788a9b5a60f258b6304b1cf88884e7b54b0ae2e849b407a6925a7d21",
